{"id":"word:hebrew:H2708","type":"word","title":"חֻקָּה","subtitle":"H2708 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"appointed, custom, manner, ordinance, site, statute.","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to חֻקָּה (H2708) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 105 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"חֻקָּה (chuqqâh) means appointed, custom, manner, ordinance, site, statute. First listed occurrence: 1Chr 29 19."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"חֻקָּה","transliteration":"chuqqâh","pronunciation":"khook-kaw'","strong":"H2708","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2708","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["חֻקַּ֥ת","חֻקַּ֤ת","לְ/חֻקַּ֣ת","חֻקֹּתַ/י֙","חֻקּוֹתַ֔/י"],"morphs":[["HNcbpc/Sp1cs",21],["HNcbsc",20],["HR/Ncbpc/Sp1cs",10],["HR/Ncbsc",9],["HNcbpc",9],["HC/Ncbpc/Sp3ms",8],["HNcbpc/Sp3ms",7],["HR/Ncbpc",6],["HC/Ncbpc/Sp1cs",6],["HNcbsa",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"appointed, custom, manner, ordinance, site, statute.","usage":"appointed, custom, manner, ordinance, site, statute.","full":"H2708. chuqqah חֻקָּה 104 noun feminine Exod 13:10 something prescribed, enactment, statute ; — ׳ח Num 9:14 2 t.; construct חֻקַּת Exod 12:14 28 t.; plural חֻקּוֺת Jer 5:24 12 t.; חֻקֹּת Lev 20:23 ; Jer 31:35 ; suffix חֻקּוֺתַי Gen 26:5 14 t.; חֻקֹּתַי Lev 18:4 21 t. etc.; — 1 singular statute , of special ritual laws: of passover Exod 13:10 (J); elsewhere only in P (and H), הפסח חקת 12:43 ; Num 9:12 , 14 ; ׳ח התורה 19:2 ; 31:21 ; ׳ח משׁפט 27:11 ; 35:29 ; ׳ח עולם Exod 12:14 , 17 ; 27:21 ; 28:43 ; 29:9 ; Lev 3:17 ; 7:36 ; 10:9 ; 16:29 , 31 , 34 ; 23:21 , 31 ; 24:3 ; Num 10:8 ; 15:15 ; 18:23 ; 19:10 , 21 (all P), Lev 17:7 ; 23:14 , 41 (H); ולאזרךְ לַגֵּר אַחַת חֻקָּה Num 9:14 ; 15:15 . 2 plural statutes: a. of nature ׳ח שׁמים Job 38:33 ; Jer 33:25 ; of moon and stars 31:35 ; of weeks of harvest 5:24 . b. figurative of a firmly established custom ׳ח הגוי(םׅ Lev 20:23 (H) 2Kin 17:8 ; ׳ח העמים Jer 10:3 ׳ח עמרי Micah 6:16 ; idolatry ׳ח ישׂראל 2Kin 17:19 ; sexual offences Lev 18:30 (H). c. ׳ח דוד statutes of David 1Kin 3:3 . d. || משׁפטים 2Sam 22:23 = Psa 18:23 (of the law known to David); || מצות 89:32 ; וח ׳ברית 1Kin 11:11 ; elsewhere of the prescriptions of the codes of D, H, P, Ezekiel: usually ומשׁפטים חקות Lev 18:5 , 26 ; 19:37 ; 20:22 (H), 25:18 ; Num 9:3 (P), 1Kin 11:33 ; Ezek 5:7 ; 11:20 ; 18:9 ; 20:11 , 13 , 19 , 21 ; preceded by מצות Deut 30:16 ; followed by מצות Lev 26:15 (H), Deut 11:1 ; 1Kin 6:12 ; ומצוה תורה 2Kin 17:34 ; or else וחקות משׁפטים Lev 18:4 ; 26:43 (H), Ezek 5:6 (twice in verse); 18:17 ; 20:16 , 24 ; 37:24 ; preceded by מצות Deut 8:11 ; in different order, ׳ח ומ ׳מצות ועדות 1Kin 2:3 ; frequently also ׳ח ומצות Lev 26:3 (H), Deut 6:2 ; 1Kin 11:38 ; 2Chr 7:19 ; or (ו)ח ׳מצות Deut 10:13 ; 28:15 , 45 ; 30:10 ; 1Kin 9:6 ; 11:34 ; Ezek 43:11 (Co), 2Kin 17:13 ; followed by תורות Gen 26:5 (R); וח ׳ועדות מצות 2Kin 23:3 ; וח ׳תורה Jer 44:10 ; ועדות וח ׳ותורה 44:23 ; ׳ח ותורות Ezek 44:5 ; 43:11 (Co); יח ׳תורות 44:24 ; special ordinances are ׳ח המזבח 43:18 ; ׳ח י ׳בית 44:5 ; ׳ח חיים 33:15 (which are life to those who keep them); ׳ח תמיד עולם ( ᵑ9 ᵑ6 ᵐ5 Talm Co strike out עולם ) 46:14 . e. phrases of obedience are ב ׳הלך Lev 18:3 ; 20:23 ; 26:3 (H), 1Kin 3:3 ; 6:12 ; 2Kin 17:8 , 19 ; Jer 44:10 , 23 ; Ezek 5:6-7 , 11:20 ; 18:9 , 17 ; 20:13 , 16 , 19 , 21 ; 33:15 ; שׁמר Lev 18:4-5 , 26 ; 19:19 , 37 ; 20:8 , 22 (H), Gen 26:5 (R), Deut 6:2 ; 8:11 ; 10:13 ; 11:1 ; 28:45 ; 30:10 , 16 ; 1Kin 2:3 ; 9:6 ; 11:11 , 34 , 38 ; 2Kin 17:13 ; 23:3 ; Ezek 18:19 , 21 ; 37:24 ; 43:11 ; 44:24 ; עשׂה Lev 25:18 (P), Deut 28:15 ; 1Kin 11:33 ; כח ׳עשׂה 2Kin 17:34 ; ׳בח אֶשְׁתַּעֲשָׁ֑ע Psa 119:16 ; phrases of disobedience are ח ׳מאס Ezek 20:24 בח ׳מאס Lev 26:15 (H); געל 26:43 (H); עזב 2Chr 7:19 ; חלל Psa 89:32 . &#8212; [ חֹק and חֻקָּה differ somewhat in shade of meaning and frequency in various writings: e.g. חֹק oftener in Job Psalms Proverbs ( חֻקָּה not at all Proverbs, once Job), and in Chronicles ( חֻקָּה only 2Chr 7:19 ); חֻקָּה often in Kings, rarely in Hexateuch except in P (H); in prophets, חֹק occurs Amos 2:4 ; Isa 5:14 ; 24:5 ; Micah 7:11 Jeremiah 3 t., Ezekiel 6 t., חֻקָּה only Ezekiel, Jeremiah (6 t.) and 6:16 ; חֻקִּים especially in Deuteronomy and Psalm 119, חֻקּוֺת especially in H, Ezekiel and sometimes (8 t.) Deuteronomy; עוֺלָם חֹק usually = due , ע ׳חֻקַּת much more often statute, ordinance , etc.]","rootNote":"feminine of 2706 , and meaning substantially the same","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 29 19","keyReferences":["1Chr 29 19","1Kgs 2 3","1Kgs 3 3","1Kgs 6 12","1Kgs 9 6","1Kgs 11 11","1Kgs 11 33","1Kgs 11 34"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":105,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 29 19","book":"1Chr","chapter":29,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/חֻקֶּ֑י/ךָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncbpc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 2 3","book":"1Kgs","chapter":2,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֻקֹּתָ֤י/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 3 3","book":"1Kgs","chapter":3,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/חֻקּ֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncbpc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 12","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/חֻקֹּתַ/י֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncbpc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"1Kgs 9 6","book":"1Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֻקֹּתַ֔/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbpc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"1Kgs 11 11","book":"1Kgs","chapter":11,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/חֻקֹּתַ֔/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncbpc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"1Kgs 11 33","book":"1Kgs","chapter":11,"verse":33,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/חֻקֹּתַ֥/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncbpc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"1Kgs 11 34","book":"1Kgs","chapter":11,"verse":34,"englishText":"",